06.930">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.930" end="00:10.710"><span begin="00:06.930" end="00:07.050">And </span><span begin="00:07.050" end="00:07.380">she's </span><span begin="00:07.380" end="00:07.590">an </span><span begin="00:07.590" end="00:08.400">actress</span><span begin="00:08.400" end="00:08.970">, </span><span begin="00:08.970" end="00:09.180">but </span><span begin="00:09.180" end="00:09.450">she </span><span begin="00:09.450" end="00:09.630">ain't </span><span begin="00:09.630" end="00:09.900">got </span><span begin="00:09.900" end="00:10.020">no </span><span begin="00:10.020" end="00:10.560">need</span><span begin="00:10.560" end="00:10.710">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.710" end="00:14.880"><span begin="00:10.710" end="00:11.040">She's </span><span begin="00:11.040" end="00:11.250">got </span><span begin="00:11.250" end="00:11.670">money </span><span begin="00:11.670" end="00:12.150">from </span><span begin="00:12.150" end="00:12.720">parents </span><span begin="00:12.720" end="00:12.930">in </span><span begin="00:12.930" end="00:13.020">a </span><span begin="00:13.020" end="00:13.380">trust </span><span begin="00:13.380" end="00:13.620">fund </span><span begin="00:13.620" end="00:13.920">back </span><span begin="00:13.920" end="00:14.280">east</span><span begin="00:14.280" end="00:14.880">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.880" end="00:18.150"><span begin="00:14.880" end="00:15.660">Tongues</span><span begin="00:15.660" end="00:16.290">, </span><span begin="00:16.290" end="00:16.770">always </span><span begin="00:16.770" end="00:17.130">pressed </span><span begin="00:17.130" end="00:17.220">to </span><span begin="00:17.220" end="00:17.430">your </span><span begin="00:17.430" end="00:18.060">cheeks</span><span begin="00:18.060" end="00:18.150">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.150" end="00:21.840"><span begin="00:18.150" end="00:18.420">While </span><span begin="00:18.420" end="00:18.570">my </span><span begin